    <decisions>
        <description>ISNEW_Legal: Customer Related (Contracts/Amendments) - Sends Email of Contracts/Amendments while creation
ISNEW_Legal: Litigation/Dispute/Incident - Sends Email of Litigation/Dispute while creation
ISNEW_All Other Record Types - Sends Email of Other Record Types while creation
ISCHANGED Status - Sends Email of Status Change
ISCHANGED Owner - Sends Email of Owner Change only prior value is in Queue</description>
        <name>Send_Email_Alerts_accordingly</name>
